  m_Name: B_Good
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: PlateCheck::PlateCheck.Data.CounselingOptionData
  text: It sounds like you enjoy a sweet treat. What if you kept a smaller piece for later and added beans or chicken so the meal keeps you full longer?
  quality: 0
  clientReaction: A smaller piece later works. I didn't think about protein keeping me full.
  explanation: Respects that the client enjoys dessert, suggests a trade instead of a ban, and links protein to something the client cares about.
